excluded from the number of shares of our common stock beneficially owned prior to the offering (i)&nbsp;all of the shares of our common stock that we may issue and sell to Lincoln Park pursuant to the Purchase Agreement that are being registered
for resale under the registration statement that includes this prospectus, because the issuance and sale of such shares to </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
 <p STYLE="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&nbsp;</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman" ALIGN="center">25 </P>

</DIV></Center>


